5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to be rigorous. I'm particularly concerned about how a new addition will impact our reporting overhead and the transparency of their figures.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. I believe we should also consider the human element—specifically, how much of our time will be consumed by staffing their growth.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is always a pleasure to see such passion. I wonder if we might also look at how well their customers truly stay with them?,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We should be mindful of our own liquidity. I want to understand the long-term capital demands and our options for leverage.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,"All very standard. However, I'm more interested in the friction between funding and actual deployment. I want to know what actually stops the clock.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, staffing is important, but if the numbers are a black box, the growth is irrelevant. We need independent verification.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"A fair point, Mizuki. I simply wish for a process that doesn't leave us exhausted by recruitment requests.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Let us be gentle with the candidates, but honest with ourselves. I believe the truth of the returns lies in the retention.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, retention is a growth metric. I am talking about the fund's survival. We need to know about follow-on calls.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,You are all focusing on the destination. I am focusing on the road. I want to see the security review timelines.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I'll take the lead on the audit and reporting side. I want to see the appraisal needs and the independent checks.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench. I want to see who is actually available.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall look into the account retention through price rises and the delivery records of our holdings. I want to see the reality.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I will investigate the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'll handle the security review time and the delivery records. I want to see where the bottlenecks are hidden.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
